DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260713T214500
UID:c8ec6935a30b89f57a2fde4e@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Padmavajra is one of our most senior Order Members and is an e
 ngaging\, direct and inspiring man. He lives at Padmaloka\, the men's Ordi
 nation training centre and regularly leads study retreats there. He was a 
 lifelong friend to Bhante Sangharakshita\, the founder of the Triratna Bud
 dhist Community.
